<title>UK: OZ Holding sets put warrants on Nestle.</title>
<headline>OZ Holding sets put warrants on Nestle.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>OZ Holding says it has issued a total on 1.5 million European-style put warrants, on Nestle SA registered shares.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one shares.</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     9.00 SFR</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   18.JUL.97		 PAYDATE	04.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 10</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
